    <briefdescription>
<para>cliquet (Ratchet) option </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A cliquet option, also known as Ratchet option, is a series of forward-starting (a.k.a. deferred strike) options where the strike for each forward start option is set equal to a fixed percentage of the spot price at the beginning of each period.</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000021"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>add local/global caps/floors</para></listitem><listitem><para>add accrued coupon and last fixing</para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
